				- secondary name servers are for load balancing \
\
			- A records: ipv4\
				**host records \
				- ipv4 association with hostname\
\
			- AAAA records: ipv6 \
				**host records \
				- ipv6 association with hostname 	 \
\
			- pointer records(PTR)\
